# Parts Specification: 1000cc High-Impedance Fuel Injectors (Set of 4)

**SKU:** ID1000-HI-4CYL

**Part ID:** 105

**Category:** Fuel System

**Manufacturer:** Injector Dynamics

## Compatibility

Only required if the ECU tune (`part_id 103`) targets more than 320 whp. Below that threshold, the stock injectors have enough headroom and this part can be skipped entirely.

High-impedance injectors only. Do not mix with a low-impedance ECU tune, as this can cause erratic idle and a check-engine code for injector circuit malfunction.

Requires updated injector scaling data to be loaded into the ECU tune before first start. Installing the injectors without updating the tune's injector data will cause a severe rich condition.

## Torque Specs

- **Fuel rail mounting bolts:** 10 Nm.
- **Injector retaining clips:** Hand-tight, snap-fit — no torque specification. Confirm full seating by feel and visually check the clip position.

## Installation Order

**Install After:** `part_id 103`

The injectors must be installed after the ECU tune is prepared to support the updated injector scaling data.

## Special Instructions

Replace injector O-rings even if the old ones look fine. A marginal O-ring can cause a vacuum/fuel leak that is very difficult to diagnose after the intake manifold is back on.